WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:02.014 --> 00:00:04.753
- (laughing) On the internet, sure.

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.980
Hi, I'm Henry Cavill,
and I'm here at BuzzFeed

00:00:10.980 --> 00:00:14.203
to read some thirst tweets, here goes.

00:00:14.437 --> 00:00:16.717
"Henry Cavill, I love you
with your glowing skin

00:00:16.717 --> 00:00:19.857
