beautiful curls in your hair,

00:00:19.857 --> 00:00:21.250
"I just want to hug you

00:00:21.327 --> 00:00:23.100
"because you are the love of my life."

00:00:23.100 --> 00:00:25.853
Ooh, not nearly as thirsty
as I thought it might be,

00:00:26.230 --> 00:00:27.880
I've read worse things in my comments.

00:00:27.880 --> 00:00:31.027
United TOPS of Smash Bros (laughing)

00:00:31.027 --> 00:00:33.627
"Henry Cavill can like, stick his tongue

00:00:33.627 --> 00:00:35.100
"down my throat, I guess."

00:00:35.100 --> 00:00:37.543
Thanks, thanks for the opportunity.

00:00:37.830 --> 00:00:39.330
That definitely got thirstier.

00:00:39.397 --> 00:00:42.430
"Henry Cavill could
destroy my body and my life

00:00:42.437 --> 00:00:45.887
"and all I'd say is so does
tomorrow work for you too?"

00:00:46.130 --> 00:00:48.807
Yes Sam, tomorrow does work for me too.

00:00:48.827 --> 00:00:51.890
"Can I just say it Henry Cavill can

00:00:52.527 --> 00:00:56.290
