can superman this hoe."

00:00:56.290 --> 00:00:58.863
That's very kind of you,
I appreciate your vigor.

00:00:59.600 --> 00:01:03.027
But um, don't hurt yourself,
be careful out there.

00:01:03.027 --> 00:01:05.530
"I would let Henry Cavill split me in half

00:01:05.957 --> 00:01:07.157
"I'm just gonna say it."

00:01:08.140 --> 00:01:09.190
Thanks for saying it.

00:01:09.210 --> 00:01:11.097
What do people get up
to in their free time?

00:01:11.097 --> 00:01:13.367
"Henry Cavill could
leave me on read at 4:30,

00:01:13.367 --> 00:01:17.327
