00:01:19.200 --> 00:01:20.340
I really do need to get Twitter,

00:01:20.340 --> 00:01:21.850
could spend hours reading this stuff.

00:01:21.850 --> 00:01:23.197
Okay, this is the last one.

00:01:23.197 --> 00:01:26.823
"Henry Cavill definitely
