00:01:34.800 --> 00:01:35.633
Thank you.

00:01:35.633 --> 00:01:37.793
Why the 1%, I ask?

00:01:38.800 --> 00:01:40.250
And, furthermore, no comment.

00:01:40.830 --> 00:01:41.663
See you BuzzFeed,

00:01:41.663 --> 00:01:44.233
